}}'''Fire Pig''' is a [[:Category:Godly|godly]] pet that was released along with the [[Season 1]] update. It can be obtained from the [[Common Egg]] through hatching it, or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Fire Pig has the same design as the [[Pig]], but its whole body is bright red with a fire trail leading behind it.

== Trivia ==
*This item is the non-chroma version of [[Chroma Fire Pig]] and the fire version of [[Pig]].

